#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10342
msgid "Build pages visually while Minn protects Breakdance-owned content and links straight to its builder. Download the plugin .zip from Breakdance."
msgstr "Crea pagine visivamente mentre Minn protegge i contenuti di proprietà di Breakdance e rimanda direttamente al suo builder. Scarica il file .zip del plugin da Breakdance."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10354
msgid "Build forms and manage their entries, notifications, feeds, and daily settings in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from your Gravity account."
msgstr "Crea moduli e gestiscine voci, notifiche, feed e impostazioni quotidiane in Minn. Scarica il file .zip del plugin dal tuo account Gravity."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10366
msgid "Send and track WordPress email through the full Email surface in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from a qualifying Gravity account."
msgstr "Invia e monitora le email di WordPress tramite l’intera area Email di Minn. Scarica il file .zip del plugin da un account Gravity idoneo."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10378
msgid "Manage the Perfmatters settings estate from Minn's Performance surface. Download the paid plugin .zip from Perfmatters."
msgstr "Gestisci tutte le impostazioni di Perfmatters dall’area Prestazioni di Minn. Scarica il file .zip del plugin a pagamento da Perfmatters."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10390
msgid "Bring ACF PRO repeaters, flexible content, galleries, options pages, blocks, and field groups into Minn. Download the plugin .zip from ACF."
msgstr "Porta in Minn ripetitori, contenuti flessibili, gallerie, pagine delle opzioni, blocchi e gruppi di campi di ACF PRO. Scarica il file .zip del plugin da ACF."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10402
msgid "Manage Elementor form submissions in Minn while keeping Elementor-owned page content protected. Download the plugin .zip from Elementor."
msgstr "Gestisci gli invii dei moduli Elementor in Minn mantenendo protetti i contenuti delle pagine di proprietà di Elementor. Scarica il file .zip del plugin da Elementor."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10414
msgid "Manage WPForms Pro entries, read and starred state, spam, trash, search, and form filters in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from WPForms."
msgstr "Gestisci in Minn le voci WPForms Pro, lo stato letto e preferito, lo spam, il cestino, la ricerca e i filtri dei moduli. Scarica il file .zip del plugin da WPForms."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10426
msgid "Clear WP Rocket caches from Minn and monitor its license alongside other paid components. Download the plugin .zip from WP Rocket."
msgstr "Svuota le cache di WP Rocket da Minn e monitorane la licenza insieme agli altri componenti a pagamento. Scarica il file .zip del plugin da WP Rocket."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10438
msgid "Feed AnalyticsWP traffic and drill-down data into Minn's Overview. Download the paid plugin .zip from AnalyticsWP."
msgstr "Invia i dati di traffico e di dettaglio di AnalyticsWP alla Panoramica di Minn. Scarica il file .zip del plugin a pagamento da AnalyticsWP."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10450
msgid "Sell recurring products and services with WooCommerce. This paid extension is installed by uploading the .zip downloaded from WooCommerce.com."
msgstr "Vendi prodotti e servizi ricorrenti con WooCommerce. Questa estensione a pagamento si installa caricando il file .zip scaricato da WooCommerce.com."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10462
msgid "Sell memberships that unlock restricted content, products and discounts. This paid extension is installed by uploading the .zip downloaded from WooCommerce.com."
